Z||000000||gtsonly||10-28-2001||08:49 PM||||What do you compare driving the Fiero to? This can be a fun question. Let's see how we all answer this,<P>Driving my fiero is like like going to the bathroom for the first while undertaking a nite of drinking. Man does it feel good but I know I am going to be in that bathroom every ten minutes doing the same thing. Kind'a like working on a Fiero, eh?<BR><P>------------------<BR>Chris Hatch <BR>1986 GT w/T-TOPs||||reg||6
